{"version":1,"content":"<p>在80、90年代港產片及電視劇中老是常出現的「御用執法人員」、人稱「日本仔」的資深綠葉演員田沃豐（又名田自義），雖然大家單聽名字未必第一時間認得出，但只要見到他的標誌性面孔，定會認得他曾飾演過無數次執法人員。</p><p>自1994年退出娛樂圈並移民加拿</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:45:55.955649+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T12:44:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:05.148507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:05.148507+00:00","content_hash":"14903633f4bffb3b53bf39ac94df57252550ceeae1d35a3e0d7fedf2439e4fbc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}